{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg9vpHFfSxDD77dA3woc3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NKTsHBbhCHmLSJCFSU3gKZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add recovery.go recovery_test.go && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(recover): suppress http.ErrAbortHandler in recover\n\nhttp.ErrAbortHandler is the sentinel panic net/http uses to abort a\nhandler without logging a stack trace. The recovery middleware treated\nit like any other panic: it logged a full stack trace and wrote a 500.\nHandle it like a broken connection instead: log one line, record the\nerror on the context and abort without writing a status.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":246,"cache_read_input_tokens":39832,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":246,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"353259a5-0c2c-46f5-9fa9-be3e789f4d5d","uuid":"aefc9d85-98de-40f2-93c5-3bd4d03c1432","timestamp":"2026-10-18T15:20:25.848Z","request_id":"req_011Cg9vpH3kMng6xu41ij2zw","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01NKTsHBbhCHmLSJCFSU3gKZ":{"command":"cd /tmp/tlw-md2hlkd8 && git add recovery.go recovery_test.go && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(recover): suppress http.ErrAbortHandler in recover\n\nhttp.ErrAbortHandler is the sentinel panic net/http uses to abort a\nhandler without logging a stack trace. The recovery middleware treated\nit like any other panic: it logged a full stack trace and wrote a 500.\nHandle it like a broken connection instead: log one line, record the\nerror on the context and abort without writing a status.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01NKTsHBbhCHmLSJCFSU3gKZ":{"cwd":"/tmp/tlw-md2hlkd8"}}}
