{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg9vpcUZG41EhvgrGv3Pw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A panic of `http.ErrAbortHandler` no longer produces a stack trace or a 500. I couldn't commit it, though: git has no author name or email set in this environment, so the change is staged but uncommitted.\n\n**Changes:**\n- `recovery.go`: a panic of `http.ErrAbortHandler` (also when wrapped) is now handled the same way as a broken pipe. It logs one line instead of a stack trace, records the error on the context, and aborts without writing a status. This matches how net/http itself handles that panic.\n- `recovery_test.go`: added `TestPanicWithAbortHandler`. It checks that the status the handler set before panicking (204) is kept, and that the log has the error message but no stack trace.\n\n**Verified:**\n- The new test failed before the fix for the expected reason: a 500 was written and a stack trace was logged.\n- It passes with the fix, and fails again when I revert only `recovery.go`.\n- `go test ./...` passes in every package, and `go vet` and `gofmt -l` report nothing.\n- `golangci-lint` isn't installed here, so it wasn't run.\n\n**Behaviour change to know about:** recovery functions passed to `CustomRecovery` / `CustomRecoveryWithWriter` are no longer called for `ErrAbortHandler`. They already weren't called for broken pipes.\n\n**To commit:** set `user.name` and `user.email`, then run `git commit` with the subject `fix(recover): suppress http.ErrAbortHandler in recover`. Or tell me which identity to use and I'll commit it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":489,"cache_read_input_tokens":40078,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":489,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"353259a5-0c2c-46f5-9fa9-be3e789f4d5d","uuid":"e6383f2b-7ea1-412c-b298-8f6f6af69837","timestamp":"2026-10-18T15:20:31.894Z","request_id":"req_011Cg9vpcFuGC1CNj8EHQFA5"}
